.\" =====================================================================
.\" HEADER
.\" =====================================================================
.CV_HEADER "Paulo Quirino" \
  "Lead Frontend Engineer & Systems Architect" \
  "Specialist in React, TypeScript, Component Systems & High-Performance Web Engines" \
  "Lisbon, Portugal" "966211859" "quirinpa@gmail.com" \
  "https://github.com/tty-pt" "github.com/tty-pt" \
  "assets/pdf/portrait.pdf"

.\" ================================ PROFILE =============================
.PROFILE_BEGIN
Frontend-focused software architect with 8+ years of commercial experience delivering complex web platforms, real-time interfaces, and large-scale applications. Expert in React, TypeScript, state orchestration, datatype-driven component systems, and micro-frontends. Complemented by low-level systems engineering in C and WebAssembly for high-performance execution.
.PROFILE_END

.\" ================================= BODY ==============================
.PT_SIZE 8.8
.LS 10.4
.TS
tab(@);
lw(242p)2 lw(242p).
T{
.SECTION EXPERIENCE
.ROLE "11/2025 – 08/2026" "Front-end & Architecture Specialist" "Loomtech" "Lisbon"
Architected the data model and block-based document editor engine with drag-and-drop layouts, dynamic formatting, and PDF/DOCX export pipelines. Designed a datatype-driven UI framework automating component reuse across 4 core entities, generating forms, tables, and infinite-scroll lists with minimal code. Implemented AI-assisted document synthesis with duplicate avoidance and semantic search.
.STACK React, TypeScript, Valtio, React-Query, Zod, TailwindCSS, Vite
.ROLE "11/2022 – 02/2025" "Lead Frontend Developer" "Mov.ai" "Lisbon"
Primary frontend engineer for an autonomous robotics platform. Built 3D interactive digital twins in BabylonJS, a visual node flow editor, and a multi-type code editor for robot programming. Engineered real-time telemetry tables and a centralized log controller serving concurrent subscribers. Modernized core stack: upgraded React 16 to 18, migrated MUI 4 to 6, and optimized build pipelines via Vite, esbuild, and Webpack.
.STACK React 18, TypeScript, BabylonJS, Material-UI 6, Remix, Vite, esbuild
.ROLE "12/2021 – 07/2022" "Front-end Developer / Tech Lead" "PrimeIT" "Lisbon"
Tech lead and frontend engineer architecting micro-frontends for an enterprise GDPR compliance platform. Pioneered datatype-driven UI architecture and pure-stack design, extracting reusable component generalizations adopted across product teams.
.STACK React, Micro-Frontends, React-Router, TypeScript, SCRUM
.ROLE "10/2020 – 11/2021" "Full-stack Developer" "UNPARALLEL" "Lisbon"
Delivered full-stack applications in Next.js and contributed to core platform features in React. Built custom WordPress plugins, integrated IoT telemetry with a custom C++ Arduino library for acoustic sensors, and authored JavaScript utility libraries.
.STACK Next.js, React, TypeScript, C++, WordPress, Node.js
.ROLE "11/2019 – 05/2020" "Full-stack Developer" "Mobinteg" "Lisbon"
Delivered full-stack web solutions and Unix administration. Architected an interoperable runtime launcher executing applications seamlessly across Angular and Mithril. Engineered an early utility-first CSS compilation engine predating modern TailwindCSS paradigms.
.STACK Angular, Mithril, TypeScript, Webpack, Babel, PHP, MySQL
T}@T{
.COLUMN_START
.ROLE "08/2017 – 08/2018" "Web & Mobile Developer" "Exictos" "Funchal"
Maintained core banking employee portals and engineered cross-platform mobile clients with React Native and Ionic. Designed structural component abstractions reducing maintenance surface, and authored a C tool for deduplicating localization assets.
.STACK React Native, Ionic, JavaScript, C, Spring Boot
.ROLE "06/2016 – 09/2016" "Software Developer (Internship)" "MIT-I" "Funchal"
Built computer vision tools to identify visually similar images using SIFT keypoint descriptors, cluster priming heuristics, and image filtering to isolate noise.
.STACK C++, SIFT, Image Processing, Heuristics
.ROLE "08/2014 – 05/2015" "Web Developer (Internship)" "CEHA" "Funchal"
Implemented full-text search over digitized historical archives, cutting query latency from weeks to under 0.14s via Elasticsearch. Built a custom ES6 module bundler ahead of modern tooling.
.STACK JavaScript, Elasticsearch, Full-Text Search, PHP
